This experiment was about connecting a Python program to a Large Language Model (LLM) using the OpenAI API. I created a main.py file to send a prompt to the model and display its response in the terminal. I stored the API key in a .env file and used the python-dotenv package to load it securely. I also created a requirements.txt file to store the required packages and a .gitignore file to prevent sensitive files from being uploaded to GitHub. After setting up everything, I ran the program and received an AI-generated response explaining Artificial Intelligence.
